# TradingScope

A Python package for trading analysis.

## Installation

```bash
make install
```

## Usage

```bash
make lint        # Run linting
make format      # Format code
make test        # Run tests
make test-cov    # Run tests with coverage
```

## Trading Agents

This project includes trading agents built with AgentScope:

- **Fundamentals Analyst Agent**: Analyzes stock fundamentals and provides investment insights

See [agents documentation](tradingscope/agents/README.md) for more details.

## Development

This project uses:
- `ruff` for linting
- `black` for formatting
- `pytest` for testing

All commands are accessible through the Makefile.
